    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your hybrid discipline reaches its apex, blending biotic and tech into a seamless defensive and offensive system. Biotic and tech powers each have their action cost <strong>reduced by 1</strong> (minimum 1 action). Tech Armor's resistance to all damage increases by <strong>2</strong>, to 5 (10 when doubled by using both kinds of power in a turn). Your biotic and tech powers deal <strong>+1d4 bonus damage</strong>.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Improved Sentinel Mastery.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: The +1d4 is added to the damage of your biotic and tech powers. The higher resistance applies while the Tech Armor effect is on you.</em></p>"
